  "description": "The meme relies on the concept of absurdity humor — using incongruous or illogical elements to create amusement. The juxtaposition of a serious, professional-looking person with a childish, nonsensical phrase is a common comedic device. This requires background knowledge of humor theory and cultural norms around comedic juxtaposition.",
